Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What you guys don't understand is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男生不了解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:06.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for us, kissing is as important as any part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:06.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对我们来说 接吻跟其他部分一样重要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:08.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:08.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everything you need to know is in that first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:16.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}初吻能告诉你所有答案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Absolutely. - Yeah, I think, for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没错 - 我想对我们来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...kissing is pretty much like an opening act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接吻只是开场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, it's like the stand-up comedian you have to sit through...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是你得忍受搞笑艺人那一段
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:26.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before Pink Floyd comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:26.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才能等到《平克·佛洛伊德》登场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and it's not that we don't like the comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我们不是不喜欢搞笑艺人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.05,0:00:36.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just that that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.05,0:00:36.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:38.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why we bought the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:38.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们买票想看的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:41.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, the problem is, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:41.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...after the concert's over, no matter how great the show was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}演唱会结束后，不论表演有多棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you girls are always looking for the comedian again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女生还在找搞笑艺人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, we're in the car, we're fighting traffic...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说我们在车里，对抗塞车
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...basically just trying to stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}努力保持清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, word of advice: Bring back the comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，听我的建议 把搞笑艺人找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:01:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Otherwise, you're gonna find yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:01:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然你会发现自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...sitting at home listening to that album alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个人坐在家里听专辑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are we still talking about sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还在讨论性爱吗？
