Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:10.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just that, doesn't she seem a little angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:10.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得她看起来有点愤怒吗？
