Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:17.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's out banging other women over the head with a club...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:17.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跑出去跟别的女人胡搞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:21.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while she sits at home trying to get the mastodon smell out of the carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:21.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她待在家里 想除掉地毯上乳齿象的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marsha, see, these are cave people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玛莎，他们是原始人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, they have issues like:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，这才是他们的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Gee, that glacier's getting kind of close." See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝天啊，冰河距离有点近〞 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Speaking of issues, isn't that your ex-wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说到问题，那不是你的前妻吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, no. - Yes, it is. Carol, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不 - 没错，卡萝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Okay. Yes. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:42.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about I'll catch up with you in the Ice Age?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:42.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们何不等到冰河时期再谈？
