Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:07.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:07.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看起来很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:12.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate that.
