Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:16.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry. Thanks. You look good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:16.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，谢谢，你看起来也很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you know, in here, anyone who...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这里所有可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:22.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...stands erect...
