Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:36.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marty's still totally paranoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:36.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玛蒂的疑心病还是很重
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, and... - Carol, why are you here, Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还有… - 卡萝，你来这里做什么？
