Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't see Ross getting all chaotic and twirly every time they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每次他们来这里，你不会看到罗斯 神经兮兮的，非常可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:05:02.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's because, as far as my parents are concerned, Ross can do no wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:05:02.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是因为我爸妈认为 罗斯绝不会犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:04.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, he's the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:04.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是我们家的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:08.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently they had some big ceremony before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:08.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然我出生前 他们举行过非常重要的仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:11.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ew, ew, ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:11.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呃 呃 呃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Ugly Naked Guy got a ThighMaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么？ - 丑裸男在用瘦腿器
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:18.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:18.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:22.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Has anybody seen my engagement ring? - Yeah, it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:22.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谁看到我的订婚戒指了？ - 对，它真的很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:33.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, God, oh, God, oh, God. - No, don't touch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:33.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 天啊 - 不，别碰那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:39.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, like I wasn't dreading tomorrow enough having to give it back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:39.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很气明天得把它还给他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:41.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Hi, Barry, remember me? I'm the girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:41.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝瑞，记得我吗？ 我是在你家人面前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that stomped on your heart in front of your entire family"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伤了你心的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:48.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God. Now I'm gonna have to return the ring, without the ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:48.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，现在我得归还戒指 戒指却不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:51.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which makes it so much harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:51.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那让情况变得更复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:54.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Easy, Rach, we'll find it. Won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:54.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别紧张，瑞秋 我们会找到它的，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, yeah. MONICA: Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 - 好吧，听着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did you have it on last?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最后一次戴上它 是什么时候的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doy. Probably right before she lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许就在她把它弄丢之前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:08.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't get a lot of "doy" these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:08.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在的人很难开得起玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:12.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I had it this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:12.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道今天早上我还戴着它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:15.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I had it when I was in the kitchen with...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:15.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道我在厨房里还戴着它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:17.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dinah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:17.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在晚餐里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, don't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别生气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:26.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You didn't. - Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:26.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不可能 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gave you one job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我交代你做一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, but look how straight those noodles are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:32.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看那些面条有多直
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:37.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, you know that's not how you look for an engagement ring in a lasagna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:37.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，那样子无法在千层面里 找到订婚戒指的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没办法那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轮到我们上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that is not a happy "hi."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你似乎不太开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Carol's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡萝怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:03.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:03.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:08.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what...? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:08.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do that for another two hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再多撑个两小时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you might be where I am right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的处境会跟我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of puts that whole pillow thing in perspective, huh, Mon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原来靠枕有那个功能，摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:24.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now, how do you fit into this whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:24.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.51,0:07:27.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Carol says she and Susan want me to be involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.51,0:07:27.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡萝说她跟苏珊都希望我能参与
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:32.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if I'm not comfortable with it, I don't have to be involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:32.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我觉得为难也可以不参与
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Basically, it's totally up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基本上由我来决定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She is so great. I miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她太棒了，我想念她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What does she mean by "involved"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说的参与是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, presumably, the biggest part of your job is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你完成最重要的工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, they want me to go down to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们要我明天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:53.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...sonogram thing with them tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:53.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}陪她们去做超声波检查
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.66,0:08:01.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No matter what I do, though, I'm still gonna be a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.66,0:08:01.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不论我怎么做，我还是要当爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this is still ruined, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千层面已经毁了，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:22.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Martha Lugwin's daughter is gonna call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:22.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玛莎路格温的女儿要打电话给你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm. What's that curry taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么咖喱的味道？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是咖喱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:31.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:31.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:36.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think they're great. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:36.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得很棒，真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:37.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You remember the Lugwins?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:37.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得路格温家吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The big one had a thing for you, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大女儿曾暗恋你，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They all had a thing for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们都暗恋他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Why is this girl going to call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 这个女孩为什么要打电话给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, she just graduated, and she wants to be something in cooking or food...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她刚毕业 想在餐饮界或食品界做事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I told her you had a restaurant, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之我跟她说你开了一家餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Mom. I don't have a restaurant. I work in a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，妈，我没有开餐厅 我在餐厅里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:09:00.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, they don't have to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:09:00.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们不必知道那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:06.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, could you come and help me with the spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:06.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，麻烦你过来帮我弄意大利面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:09.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, we're having spaghetti. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:09.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要吃意大利面，那真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太轻松了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:16.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know this is going to sound unbelievably selfish on my part...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:16.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道听起来我真的很自私
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but were you planning on bringing up the whole babylesbian thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算提起宝宝跟女同志的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I think it might take some of the heat off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想那能帮我挡些子弹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:29.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What that Rachel did to her life. We ran into her parents at the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:29.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋打算怎么过生活？ 我们在俱乐部遇到她爸妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:31.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They were not playing very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:31.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们似乎很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:34.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna tell you what they spent on that wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:34.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想告诉你们 他们花了多少钱办婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:37.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but $40,000 is a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:37.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但四万块是一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:43.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, at least she had the chance to leave a man at the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:43.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少她有机会在婚礼上甩了男人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:49.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's that supposed to mean? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:49.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那是什么意思？ - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:53.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It's an expression. - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那只是一种说法 - 不，不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:54.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't listen to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:54.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别听你妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:56.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're independent and you always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:56.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很独立 你一直都是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:59.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even when you were a kid, and you were chubby...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:59.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}即使你小时候胖嘟嘟的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you had no friends, you were just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有朋友，你还是过得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:07.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd read alone in your room. And your puzzles...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:07.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一个人在房里看书玩拼图
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:14.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, there are people, like Ross, who need to shoot for the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:14.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，像罗斯这样的人 必须追求成功
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With his museum and his papers getting published.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他到博物馆工作，准备出版论文
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Other people are satisfied with staying where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其他人则是安于现状
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:24.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, these are the people who never get cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:24.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要说的是这些人永远不会得癌症
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I read about these women trying to have it all, and I thank God...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到报道说这些女人想那么做 谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:34.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...our little Harmonica doesn't seem to have that problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:34.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的小摩妮卡没有那样的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Ross, what's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any stories? No news, no little anecdotes to share with the folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有任何故事吗？ 没有消息或趣事要跟父母分享？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:53.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ahem. Look, I, uh... I realize you guys have been wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:53.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，我知道你们一直很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:56.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...what exactly happened between Carol and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:56.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟卡萝到底是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And so, well, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情况是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Carol's a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡萝是女同志
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:07.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's living with a woman named Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:07.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她跟一个叫苏珊的女人住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:12.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's pregnant with my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:12.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她怀了我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:15.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she and Susan are going to raise the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:15.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她跟苏珊要一起抚养孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你早就知道了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:33.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your folks are really that bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们的爸妈真的有那么难过？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:41.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you know, these people are pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:41.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们可是专家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:46.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They know what they're doing. They take their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:46.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们知道自己在做什么 愿意花时间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不做完誓不甘休
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:54.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, I know they say that you can't change your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:54.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，我知道俗话说 人是无法换父母的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:57.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, if you could, I'd want yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:57.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，如果可以的话 我想跟你换父母
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Must pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得去尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:03.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it's even worse when you're twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:03.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这比你们是双胞胎还糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:06.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're a twin? - Oh, yeah. We don't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:06.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你是双胞胎？ - 对，我们不说话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's like this high-powered, driven, career-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是位高权重的霸道女强人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What does she do? - She's a waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 她做什么样的工作？ - 她是服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:16.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. You guys, I kind of gotta clean up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:16.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了，各位，我必须打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, you're an only child, right? You don't have any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，你是独生子 你不必忍受这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:23.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, no, although I did have an imaginary friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:23.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，但我有个幻想的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:25.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who my parents actually preferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:25.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸妈比较喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Hit the lights, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请关灯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.65,0:12:38.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How long was I in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.65,0:12:38.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在厕所待了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是在打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, do you, uh...? Do you need any help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你需要帮忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:47.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, okay, sure. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:47.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:58.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you nervous about Barry tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:58.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很紧张明天要跟贝瑞见面？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, a little. - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:04.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- A lot. - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:04.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So got any advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有任何建议吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:10.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, as someone who's recently been dumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:10.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毕竟你有被甩的经验
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:15.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you may want to steer clear of the word "dumped."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:15.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你该避免用〝甩〞这个字
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chances are he's going to be this broken shell of a man. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很可能心都碎了，你懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you should try not to look too terrific. I know it'll be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能看起来太漂亮 我知道那很难
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:33.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or, you know, hey, I'll go down there, and I'll give Barry back his ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:33.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是由我过去把戒指还给贝瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you can go with Carol and Susan to the OB-GYN.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你陪卡萝跟苏珊去看妇产科
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've got Carol tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明天你得去陪卡萝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did it get so complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}何时世界变得这么复杂？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:46.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:46.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你问倒我了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Remember when we were in high school? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还记得我们念高中的时候吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, didn't you think you' were gonna meet someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得你会遇上某人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:55.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...fall in love, and that'd be it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:55.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坠入爱河，就这样过了一生吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ross? - Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 罗斯 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:07.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Man. I never thought I'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:07.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，我没想到我会落到这步田地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:17.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:17.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:37.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Sorry I'm late. I got stuck at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:37.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我迟到了，我有工作在忙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There was this big dinosaur thing. Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于这个大恐龙，总之…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:47.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ross, you remember Susan. - How could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:47.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 罗斯，你记得苏珊 - 我怎么会忘记呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Susan. Good shake, good shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}苏珊，握手力道蛮不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:55.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, uh, we're just waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:55.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在等…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Dr. Oberman. - Dr. Oberman. Okay, and is he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 欧伯曼医生 - 欧伯曼医生，他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- She. - Of course, "she."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是她才对 - 当然，是她才对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She, uh, familiar with our special situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她知道我们的特殊状况吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:08.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, and she's very supportive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:08.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，她非常支持我们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great. Okay, that's great. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了，那是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:13.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:13.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:16.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CAROL: Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:16.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:32.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Quack, quack...
